+
+  ## Authentication hardening
+  ## Identifiers 1546 / 0974 / 1173 / 1504 / 1505 / 1401 / 1559 / 1560
+  ## 1561 / 1546 / 0421 / 1557 / 0422 / 1558 / 1403 / 0431
